{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00a0 As night descends, hordes of undead shall invade this land. Young warriors\u2014bearing the dragon's legacy and bound by ancient oaths\u2014stand against the coming darkness. You are the symbol of hope and light. Your defiance has enraged them, and now they come to destroy all you protect.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Strategy Game of Day and Night Cycles</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build by day, fight by night\u2014defend your homeland with both intellect and blades!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udff0\u3010Building Strategy\u3011</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>During the day, players must construct and upgrade buildings, allocate resources to develop their economy, and deploy soldiers to establish defensive systems.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648260/extras/72bcaa462bd7f18cdd8f0f0e81eea36c.poster.avif?t=1767285811\" width=1170 height=656 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648260/extras/72bcaa462bd7f18cdd8f0f0e81eea36c.webm?t=1767285811\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648260/extras/72bcaa462bd7f18cdd8f0f0e81eea36c.mp4?t=1767285811\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2694\ufe0f\u3010Defend Against Invasion\u3011</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>At night, players must control the protagonist and command soldiers in battle to repel enemy attacks.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648260/extras/fc91c8b05ac5d815b6ca2943b2363c72.poster.avif?t=1767285811\" width=1170 height=656 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648260/extras/fc91c8b05ac5d815b6ca2943b2363c72.webm?t=1767285811\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648260/extras/fc91c8b05ac5d815b6ca2943b2363c72.mp4?t=1767285811\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc32<strong>\u3010Boss Battle\u3011</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>On the final night, the map's ultimate boss will attack you. Prepare yourself and secure victory!</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648260/extras/a987a27264248404f3bc3ce08f252b3a.poster.avif?t=1767285811\" width=1170 height=656 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648260/extras/a987a27264248404f3bc3ce08f252b3a.webm?t=1767285811\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648260/extras/a987a27264248404f3bc3ce08f252b3a.mp4?t=1767285811\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfae\u3010Weapon Upgrades\u3011</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In-game, you're the strategist calling the shots. Outside the battle, you can enhance weapon capabilities or choose different weapons to engage in combat.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648260/extras/921b3c9a3ae1f6daf6fe3e368654f195.poster.avif?t=1767285811\" wi